  "note": [
    "Item catalogue.",
    "",
    "Every id below was read back from this server's live world on 2026-10-07,",
    "so the ids are real. The display names are hand-written and the categories",
    "are a judgement call, which is why provenance is 'seed' rather than",
    "'confirmed': confirm a row by hand and the seeder will stop overwriting it.",
    "",
    "max_stack is deliberately absent. The API rejects an edit whose stack",
    "exceeds the cap, so a guessed cap blocks a legitimate edit. A cap is only",
    "worth adding once it has been read off the real item.",
    "",
    "Ingest records every unknown id it sees as provenance 'observed', so the",
    "catalogue grows its own worklist. An id absent from this file still renders",
    "in the UI as its raw string rather than being hidden."
